  "userTurns": [
    "Can you tell me/ how your back pain /first started?",
    "It started about six weeks ago/ during a particularly/ busy period at work./ I was sitting at my desk/ for long hours, but /there wasn't any specific injury or incident /that triggered it.",
    "Did the pain /come on suddenly, /or did it develop gradually?",
    "It developed gradually. /At first, it was just a mild discomfort,/ but I started noticing it /more frequently over time.",
    "How has the pain changed / over the last six weeks?",
    "It's become more noticeable/ over the last few weeks. Initially, I only felt it occasionally, / but now I experience it/ almost every day.",
    "Have you experienced /anything similar in the past?",
    "Not really. /I've had occasional back stiffness /after sitting for long periods, /but I've never experienced this/ kind of persistent pain before.",
    "Have you seen a doctor /or another healthcare professional /about this problem?",
    "Yes, I saw my GP /about two weeks ago /because the pain wasn't improving.",
    "Did your GP recommend /any treatment or /further investigations?",
    "They prescribed ibuprofen /and advised me to keep moving /and avoid prolonged bed rest. /I haven't had any scans /or other investigations.",
    "Do you have /any other medical conditions /that we should be aware of?",
    "No, I don't have /any major medical conditions.",
    "Have you had any /previous injuries, /hospitalisations /or surgeries?",
    "No previous major injuries or surgeries. /I've occasionally experienced /some neck stiffness, /but nothing that required /medical treatment.",
    "Are you currently taking/ any medications or supplements?",
    "Just ibuprofen /when the pain gets worse. /I'm not taking /any other regular medication.",
    "Okay, thank you. /That's really helpful. /It gives me /a better understanding of /your medical history and /how your symptoms have developed."
  ],
